<title>USA: New Horizon opens new facility.</title>
<headline>New Horizon opens new facility.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Horizon Kids Quest said Thursday it opened a new child care facility at the newly opened Station Casinos Inc casino in Kansas City.</p>
<p>The 10,000-square-foot facility is the company's 13th, New Horizon said.</p>
<p>The company currently has plans to open two other centers in 1997 and is working with casino operators to open others, new Horizon said.</p>
<p>New Horizon shares were up 1/8 at 4-1/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
